The lab repo is a tool for working with repos, including itself. But
that doesn't mean it should modify its own working tree.

How is it currently configured, to prevent it from working on its own
files? I think it needs some idea of repo resources that it can fetch -
it just so happens that it can also work on itself (in a different
checkout).

Consider that the way I'm working with lab, I would also want to work
with any other number of repos. I just happen to be starting with lab,
and it is a bit funky because I'm using it to develop itself.
